# 必考词 Unit11
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit11核心词汇

{{ultimate}}{{/ˈʌltɪmət}}{{adj. 最终的；根本的；极限的；最好的}}{{The ultimate goal is to achieve world peace.}}
{{undergo}}{{/ˌʌndəˈɡəʊ}}{{v. 经历；承受；接受；忍受}}{{The patient underwent surgery last week.}}
{{underline}}{{/ˌʌndəˈlaɪn}}{{v. 强调；在…下面画线；突出；预告}}{{The report underlines the importance of education.}}
{{undermine}}{{/ˌʌndəˈmaɪn}}{{v. 暗中破坏；削弱；侵蚀；损害}}{{His actions undermined the team's confidence.}}
{{undertake}}{{/ˌʌndəˈteɪk}}{{v. 承担；从事；保证；许诺}}{{She undertook the difficult task of organizing the event.}}
{{unemployment}}{{/ˌʌnɪmˈplɔɪmənt}}{{n. 失业；失业率；失业人数}}{{Unemployment has risen due to the economic downturn.}}
{{uniform}}{{/ˈjuːnɪfɔːm}}{{n./adj. 制服；统一的；一致的；一律的}}{{All students must wear a school uniform.}}
{{unique}}{{/juˈniːk}}{{adj. 独特的；唯一的；独一无二的；罕见的}}{{Every person has a unique set of fingerprints.}}
{{universal}}{{/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːsl}}{{adj. 普遍的；全球的；通用的；全体的}}{{Education is a universal right.}}
{{update}}{{/ʌpˈdeɪt}}{{v./n. 更新；最新消息；现代化；使跟上时代}}{{Please update the software to the latest version.}}
{{upgrade}}{{/ʌpˈɡreɪd}}{{v./n. 升级；提升；改进；提高级别}}{{The airline upgraded him to first class.}}
{{uphold}}{{/ʌpˈhəʊld}}{{v. 支持；维护；坚持；认可；举起}}{{The court upheld the original decision.}}
{{upper}}{{/ˈʌpər}}{{adj. 上面的；上层的；上部的；高地的}}{{The upper floors of the building have a better view.}}
{{upset}}{{/ʌpˈset}}{{adj./v. 不安的；打乱；使心烦；搅乱}}{{She was upset about the bad news.}}
{{urban}}{{/ˈɜːbən}}{{adj. 城市的；都市的；城镇的；城市生活的}}{{Urban areas have better access to healthcare.}}
{{urge}}{{/ɜːdʒ}}{{v./n. 催促；强烈要求；冲动；推动力}}{{He urged the government to take immediate action.}}
{{urgent}}{{/ˈɜːdʒənt}}{{adj. 紧急的；迫切的；急切的；强求的}}{{The situation requires urgent attention.}}
{{utilize}}{{/ˈjuːtɪlaɪz}}{{v. 利用；使用；运用；应用}}{{We should utilize all available resources.}}
{{utter}}{{/ˈʌtər}}{{v./adj. 说出；完全的；彻底的；十足的}}{{He uttered a few words of comfort.}}
{{vacant}}{{/ˈveɪkənt}}{{adj. 空的；空缺的；茫然的；空闲的}}{{There is a vacant position in the marketing department.}}
{{vague}}{{/veɪɡ}}{{adj. 模糊的；不明确的；含糊的；犹豫不决的}}{{His instructions were too vague to follow.}}
{{valid}}{{/ˈvælɪd}}{{adj. 有效的；合理的；有根据的；合法的}}{{The ticket is valid for three months.}}
{{valuable}}{{/ˈvæljuəbl}}{{adj. 贵重的；有价值的；重要的；宝贵的}}{{Time is the most valuable resource.}}
{{vanish}}{{/ˈvænɪʃ}}{{v. 消失；消亡；灭绝；突然不见}}{{The ship vanished into the fog.}}
{{variable}}{{/ˈveəriəbl}}{{adj./n. 可变的；变量；变数；易变的}}{{Temperature is a key variable in the experiment.}}
{{variation}}{{/ˌveəriˈeɪʃn}}{{n. 变化；变体；变异；变动；变奏曲}}{{There is considerable variation in test scores.}}
{{variety}}{{/vəˈraɪəti}}{{n. 多样性；种类；变化；品种；综艺节目}}{{The store offers a wide variety of products.}}
{{vary}}{{/ˈveəri}}{{v. 变化；不同；改变；使多样化；偏离}}{{Prices vary depending on the season.}}
{{vast}}{{/vɑːst}}{{adj. 广阔的；大量的；巨大的；巨额的}}{{The vast desert stretches for hundreds of miles.}}
{{vehicle}}{{/ˈviːɪkl}}{{n. 车辆；交通工具；手段；媒介；传播媒介}}{{Electric vehicles are becoming more popular.}}
{{venture}}{{/ˈventʃər}}{{n./v. 冒险事业；敢于；风险投资；大胆表示}}{{He started a new venture in the tech industry.}}
{{verbal}}{{/ˈvɜːbl}}{{adj. 口头的；言语的；文字的；动词的}}{{They made a verbal agreement.}}
{{verdict}}{{/ˈvɜːdɪkt}}{{n. 裁决；判决；判断；意见；定论}}{{The jury delivered a guilty verdict.}}
{{verify}}{{/ˈverɪfaɪ}}{{v. 核实；证实；证明；查对；鉴定}}{{Please verify the information before publishing it.}}
{{version}}{{/ˈvɜːʃn}}{{n. 版本；说法；描述；译本；变体}}{{The latest version of the app has new features.}}
{{versus}}{{/ˈvɜːsəs}}{{prep. 对；与…相对；以…为对手；对抗}}{{The game is Team A versus Team B.}}
{{vertical}}{{/ˈvɜːtɪkl}}{{adj./n. 垂直的；竖的；垂直线；垂直面}}{{The cliff is almost vertical.}}
{{vessel}}{{/ˈvesl}}{{n. 船；容器；血管；脉管；器皿}}{{The blood vessel carries blood throughout the body.}}
{{veteran}}{{/ˈvetərən}}{{n./adj. 老兵；老手；经验丰富的；资深的}}{{He is a veteran of three wars.}}
{{via}}{{/ˈvaɪə}}{{prep. 通过；经由；凭借；借助于}}{{She traveled to Paris via London.}}
{{victim}}{{/ˈvɪktɪm}}{{n. 受害者；牺牲品；受灾者；受骗者}}{{The victims of the earthquake received aid from the government.}}
{{violate}}{{/ˈvaɪəleɪt}}{{v. 违反；侵犯；亵渎；打扰；强奸}}{{He was arrested for violating the law.}}
{{violence}}{{/ˈvaɪələns}}{{n. 暴力；暴行；猛烈；激烈；狂热}}{{Violence is never the solution to a problem.}}
{{virtual}}{{/ˈvɜːtʃuəl}}{{adj. 虚拟的；实际上的；实质上的；模拟的}}{{Virtual reality technology is advancing rapidly.}}
{{visible}}{{/ˈvɪzəbl}}{{adj. 看得见的；明显的；有形的；可察觉的}}{{The stars were clearly visible in the night sky.}}
{{vision}}{{/ˈvɪʒn}}{{n. 视力；想象；远见；眼光；幻象}}{{She has a clear vision for the company's future.}}
{{vital}}{{/ˈvaɪtl}}{{adj. 至关重要的；生命的；致命的；充满活力的}}{{Water is vital for human survival.}}
{{vivid}}{{/ˈvɪvɪd}}{{adj. 生动的；鲜明的；逼真的；强烈的}}{{She gave a vivid description of the event.}}
{{volume}}{{/ˈvɒljuːm}}{{n. 卷；体积；音量；量；大量；容积}}{{The volume of traffic increases during rush hour.}}
{{voluntary}}{{/ˈvɒləntri}}{{adj. 自愿的；志愿的；义务的；无偿的}}{{Participation in the program is voluntary.}}
{{vote}}{{/vəʊt}}{{n./v. 投票；表决；选举权；选票；投票结果}}{{All citizens have the right to vote.}}
{{vulnerable}}{{/ˈvʌlnərəbl}}{{adj. 脆弱的；易受伤的；易受攻击的；敏感的}}{{Children are particularly vulnerable to the effects of pollution.}}
{{wage}}{{/weɪdʒ}}{{n. 工资；报酬；代价； wages；工资收入}}{{The minimum wage has been raised this year.}}
{{wander}}{{/ˈwɒndər}}{{v. 漫步；迷路；走神；蜿蜒；离题}}{{She wandered through the old town, enjoying the scenery.}}
{{warn}}{{/wɔːn}}{{v. 警告；提醒；告诫；预先通知}}{{The sign warns visitors about the danger.}}
{{waste}}{{/weɪst}}{{n./v./adj. 浪费；废物；废弃的；荒芜的}}{{Don't waste your time on trivial matters.}}
{{wealth}}{{/welθ}}{{n. 财富；丰富；大量；富裕；资源}}{{Health is more important than wealth.}}
{{weave}}{{/wiːv}}{{v. 编织；编造；迂回行进；组合；使交织}}{{The spider weaves a web to catch insects.}}
{{welfare}}{{/ˈwelfeər}}{{n. 福利；幸福；健康；福利事业；社会保障}}{{The government provides welfare for the poor.}}
{{whereas}}{{/weərˈæz}}{{conj. 然而；但是；鉴于；尽管}}{{He is tall, whereas his brother is short.}}
{{widespread}}{{/ˈwaɪdspred}}{{adj. 广泛的；普遍的；分布广的；大量的}}{{There is widespread support for the policy.}}
{{wild}}{{/waɪld}}{{adj. 野生的；狂野的；荒凉的；疯狂的；未开化的}}{{Wild animals should be protected in their natural habitat.}}
{{willing}}{{/ˈwɪlɪŋ}}{{adj. 愿意的；乐意的；自愿的；积极肯干的}}{{She is willing to help with the project.}}
{{wind}}{{/waɪnd}}{{v./n. 蜿蜒；风；上发条；呼吸；卷绕}}{{The river winds through the valley.}}
{{wisdom}}{{/ˈwɪzdəm}}{{n. 智慧；明智；学识；古训；至理名言}}{{With age comes wisdom.}}
{{wit}}{{/wɪt}}{{n. 智慧；机智；风趣；头脑；智力}}{{He is known for his sharp wit and humor.}}
{{withdraw}}{{/wɪðˈdrɔː}}{{v. 撤退；提取；收回；退出；撤回}}{{She withdrew money from the bank.}}
{{withhold}}{{/wɪðˈhəʊld}}{{v. 扣留；保留；隐瞒；抑制；忍住}}{{The company withheld information from the public.}}
{{withstand}}{{/wɪðˈstænd}}{{v. 承受；抵挡；经受住；顶住；抵抗}}{{The building can withstand strong earthquakes.}}
{{witness}}{{/ˈwɪtnəs}}{{n./v. 目击者；见证；目击；证明；表明}}{{She witnessed the accident from her window.}}
{{wonder}}{{/ˈwʌndər}}{{n./v. 惊奇；想知道；奇迹；惊叹；怀疑}}{{I wonder what the future will bring.}}
{{workshop}}{{/ˈwɜːkʃɒp}}{{n. 车间；研讨会；工作坊；讲习班；创作室}}{{The workshop was very informative and practical.}}
{{worth}}{{/wɜːθ}}{{adj./n. 值得的；价值；财产；意义；作用}}{{The book is worth reading.}}
{{wound}}{{/wuːnd}}{{n./v. 伤口；受伤；伤害；创伤；损害}}{{The soldier was wounded in battle.}}
{{wrap}}{{/ræp}}{{v./n. 包裹；包装；覆盖；围巾；结束}}{{She wrapped the gift in colorful paper.}}
{{yield}}{{/jiːld}}{{v./n. 产出；屈服；收益；产量；让步}}{{The farm yields a good harvest every year.}}
{{zone}}{{/zəʊn}}{{n. 地区；区域；地带；范围；时区}}{{The area has been declared a disaster zone.}}
